#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Job limits imposed by the job validation service for jobs sent to IBM QPUs."
msgstr "Batas job yang diterapkan oleh layanan validasi job untuk job yang dikirim ke QPU IBM."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Job limits"
msgstr "Batas job"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Job limits {#job-limits}"
msgstr "Batas job {#job-limits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you send a job to an IBM&reg; QPU, it is first validated to try to ensure that the job can run on the QPU, to decrease the likelihood that your job fails after you've waited for it to go through the queue. These checks include enforcing the following described limits. If these limits are exceeded, that workload cannot be handled by the quantum software stack and will usually fail.\n"
msgstr "Ketika kamu mengirim job ke QPU IBM&reg;, job tersebut pertama-tama dikirim ke layanan validasi job. Layanan ini berusaha memastikan bahwa job dapat berjalan di QPU sehingga kamu tidak perlu menunggu dalam antrean lalu menghadapi kegagalan job. Pemeriksaan ini mencakup penegakan batas-batas yang dijelaskan berikut. Jika batas-batas ini dilampaui, beban kerja tersebut tidak dapat ditangani oleh tumpukan perangkat lunak kuantum dan biasanya akan gagal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- Certain primitive options increase the circuit size.  The described limits are checked _after_ the expected increase in circuit size. In particular, these options increase circuit size:\n"
"  - Dynamical decoupling and gate-folding ZNE introduce additional gates that are included in the instructions for the [Maximum number of low-level instructions per qubit](#per-qubit) limit.\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE introduces additional two-qubit gates relevant to the [Maximum number of two-qubit gates per job](#2-qubit-limit) limit. The number of two-qubit gates is multiplied by the sum of noise factors requested in gate-folding ZNE.\n"
"- The limits reported by the `backend.configuration()` fields `max_shots` and `max_experiments` are no longer relevant or enforced. These fields will be removed in the near future.\n"
"- These limits are per job, not per Primitive Unified Bloc (PUB). \n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Catatan\">\n"
"- Beberapa opsi primitif meningkatkan ukuran Circuit. Batas yang dijelaskan diperiksa _setelah_ perkiraan peningkatan ukuran Circuit. Secara khusus, opsi-opsi berikut meningkatkan ukuran Circuit:\n"
"  - Dynamical decoupling dan gate-folding ZNE memperkenalkan Gate tambahan yang disertakan dalam instruksi untuk batas [Jumlah maksimum instruksi tingkat rendah per qubit](#per-qubit).\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE memperkenalkan Gate dua-Qubit tambahan yang relevan dengan batas [Jumlah maksimum Gate dua-Qubit per job](#2-qubit-limit). Jumlah Gate dua-Qubit dikalikan dengan jumlah faktor kebisingan yang diminta dalam gate-folding ZNE.\n"
"- Batas yang dilaporkan oleh field `backend.configuration()` yaitu `max_shots` dan `max_experiments` tidak lagi relevan atau diterapkan. Field-field ini akan dihapus dalam waktu dekat.\n"
"- Batas-batas ini berlaku per job, bukan per Primitive Unified Bloc (PUB).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"max-shots\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"max-shots\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maximum executions {#maximum-executions}"
msgstr "Jumlah eksekusi maksimum {#maximum-executions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At most, **10 million** executions are allowed for Sampler jobs due to output size.  The number of executions is the number of circuits times the number of shots, where the circuits are those generated after PUB elements are broadcasted.\n"
msgstr "Paling banyak, **10 juta** eksekusi diperbolehkan untuk job Sampler karena ukuran output. Jumlah eksekusi adalah jumlah Circuit dikalikan jumlah shot, di mana Circuit-Circuit tersebut adalah yang dihasilkan setelah elemen PUB di-broadcast.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For example, if you have a PUB with one circuit and parameters with shape (4, 1), this would render 4 circuits. If you requested 2,000 shots, then the total number of executions is $4 \\times 2,000 = 8,000$.\n"
msgstr "Misalnya, jika kamu memiliki PUB dengan satu sirkuit dan parameter berbentuk (4, 1), ini akan menghasilkan 4 Circuit. Jika kamu meminta 2.000 shot, maka total jumlah eksekusi adalah $4 \\times 2,000 = 8,000$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that if you enable Pauli-twirling in your Sampler job, the total number of shots is based on the `num_randomizations` and `shots_per_randomization` values. See [TwirlingOptions](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-twirling-options) for more details.\n"
msgstr "Perlu diperhatikan bahwa jika kamu mengaktifkan Pauli-twirling dalam job Sampler kamu, total jumlah shot didasarkan pada nilai `num_randomizations` dan `shots_per_randomization`. Lihat [TwirlingOptions](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-twirling-options) untuk detail lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"per-qubit\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"per-qubit\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maximum number of low-level instructions per qubit {#maximum-number-of-low-level-instructions-per-qubit}"
msgstr "Jumlah maksimum instruksi tingkat rendah per qubit {#maximum-number-of-low-level-instructions-per-qubit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The service permits up to **26.8 million control-system instructions per qubit**. This ensures that the user circuits fit within the control system's instruction memory.  The below example shows how to transpile a circuit and count how many of each instruction there are. \n"
msgstr "Layanan mengizinkan hingga **26,8 juta instruksi sistem kontrol per qubit**. Ini memastikan bahwa Circuit pengguna muat dalam memori instruksi sistem kontrol. Contoh di bawah ini menunjukkan cara men-transpile Circuit dan menghitung berapa banyak setiap instruksi yang ada.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following table describes how the system translates instruction set architecture (ISA) circuit instructions to control system instructions when calculating this limit.\n"
msgstr "Tabel berikut menjelaskan bagaimana sistem menerjemahkan instruksi Circuit instruction set architecture (ISA) ke instruksi sistem kontrol saat menghitung batas ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Instruction | Count |\n"
"|-------------|-------|\n"
"| `rz`          | 1     |\n"
"| `delay`       | 1     |\n"
"| `sx`          | 2     |\n"
"| `x`           | 2     |\n"
"| `cx`          | 5     |\n"
"| `cz`          | 5     |\n"
"| `ecr`         | 5     |\n"
"| `measure`     | 10    |\n"
"| `reset`       | 17    |\n"
"| `init`        | 50    |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Instruksi | Jumlah |\n"
"|-------------|-------|\n"
"| `rz`          | 1     |\n"
"| `delay`       | 1     |\n"
"| `sx`          | 2     |\n"
"| `x`           | 2     |\n"
"| `cx`          | 5     |\n"
"| `cz`          | 5     |\n"
"| `ecr`         | 5     |\n"
"| `measure`     | 10    |\n"
"| `reset`       | 17    |\n"
"| `init`        | 50    |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  This table captures the heuristic used in validation and does not reflect the exact number of instructions used to implement an operation.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  Tabel ini menangkap heuristik yang digunakan dalam validasi dan tidak mencerminkan jumlah instruksi yang tepat yang digunakan untuk mengimplementasikan sebuah operasi.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example {#example}"
msgstr "Contoh {#example}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define circuits, transpile them, and get a count of how many gates will be run.\n"
msgstr "Definisikan Circuit-Circuit, transpile, dan dapatkan hitungan berapa banyak Gate yang akan dijalankan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For full details, see [Transpile against custom backends](/guides/custom-backend#ex-count-ops).\n"
msgstr "Untuk detail lengkap, lihat [Transpile terhadap Backend kustom.](/guides/custom-backend#ex-count-ops)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"2-qubit-limit\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"2-qubit-limit\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maximum number of single- and two-qubit gates per circuit {#maximum-number-of-single-and-two-qubit-gates-per-circuit}"
msgstr "Jumlah maksimum Gate satu-Qubit dan dua-Qubit per Circuit {#maximum-number-of-single-and-two-qubit-gates-per-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The maximum number of single-qubit gates are as follows:\n"
"- 30 million RZ gates\n"
"- 20 million SX gates\n"
msgstr ""
"Jumlah maksimum Gate satu-Qubit adalah sebagai berikut:\n"
"- 30 juta Gate RZ\n"
"- 20 juta Gate SX\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The maximum number of two-qubit gates per circuit is five million. This ensures that the job can be manipulated within the memory limits of the low-level software stack.\n"
msgstr "Jumlah maksimum Gate dua-Qubit per Circuit adalah lima juta. Ini memastikan bahwa job dapat dimanipulasi dalam batas memori tumpukan perangkat lunak tingkat rendah.\n"
